{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow", "label": "ADR-0006: Spec/plan workflow replaces per-task prompts", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "header", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_seven_phase_workflow", "label": "Seven-phase workflow (decide, spec, tickets, plan, execute, PR, merge)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces the M0 per-task-prompt workflow: that gave no canonical artifact between idea and code, no spec layer for tickets to link, no stable path a PR could reference, and left the process invisible in the repo - weak as portfolio evidence, which is one of the project's goals. Phases 1-3 run by the user (skills are user-invoked via disable-model-invocation), phases 4-6 by the agent, merge by the user; one skill per phase where skills overlap."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_git_worktrees_disabled", "label": "Git worktrees disabled (work in place on one feature branch)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The dev stack bind-mounts exactly this path (ADR-0004), so a worktree in another directory is not seen by the containers and PHPUnit/Behat would execute against the wrong tree. The alternative - a docker override mounting each worktree - was rejected: it means editing local.yml in the pinned moodle-docker clone per branch and stacks per-branch state on top of the shadow-volume trick ADR-0004 already needs. superpowers:using-git-worktrees Step 0 honors a declared preference, so the override lives in AGENTS.md. Consequence: subagent implementers run strictly sequentially in the one tree."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_canonical_spec_file", "label": "Canonical spec file (docs/specs/NNN-slug.md)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provides the stable artifact between idea and code: it lands on main through a small docs PR before tickets are cut so tickets link a stable path; the GitHub parent issue links to it and does not duplicate it; specs are committed and never deleted so the repo itself demonstrates the process."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_per_ticket_plan_file", "label": "Per-ticket implementation plan (docs/plans/<issue#>-slug.md)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Agent-written with the superpowers:writing-plans template plus front matter, and committed as the first commit of the ticket's PR so the PR reads spec -> plan -> code."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_per_task_prompts", "label": "Per-task prompt workflow (docs/tasks/ + docs/task-template.md)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected and removed (user call, 2026-11-23): no canonical spec layer, no stable link targets, process invisible in the repo. Its M1 scope lives on in docs/plan.md."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_parent_issue_link_stub", "label": "Parent issue as link stub (no ready-for-agent)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Skill defaults overridden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The GitHub parent issue links to the spec and never duplicates it; the ready-for-agent label is reserved for tickets only, so the parent is a link stub and not agent-grabbable work."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_wayfinder", "label": "wayfinder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_grill_with_docs", "label": "grill-with-docs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_to_spec", "label": "to-spec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Skill defaults overridden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default (publish the spec as a tracker issue with ready-for-agent) is overridden to: canonical file docs/specs/NNN-slug.md plus a link-stub parent issue with no ready-for-agent label. Mechanism: AGENTS.md prefs + docs/agents/issue-tracker.md, the tracker doc the skill consults."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_to_tickets", "label": "to-tickets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_writing_plans", "label": "writing-plans", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Skill defaults overridden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default plan location docs/superpowers/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature>.md is overridden to docs/plans/<issue#>-slug.md; the skill itself says user preferences override the location."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_subagent_driven_development", "label": "subagent-driven-development", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its 'never start on main' rule still applies via the feature-branch requirement, and it already forbids parallel implementers, which makes strictly sequential subagent implementers in the single shared tree safe."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_executing_plans", "label": "executing-plans", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Skill defaults overridden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_test_driven_development", "label": "test-driven-development", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_requesting_code_review", "label": "requesting-code-review", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_finishing_a_development_branch", "label": "finishing-a-development-branch", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Skill defaults overridden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default three integration options narrowed: the expected choice is 'push and create a PR', and the merge itself happens on GitHub by the user (preference note in docs/workflow.md phase 7)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_using_git_worktrees", "label": "using-git-worktrees", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its Step 0 explicitly honors a worktree preference declared in instructions, which is the mechanism that makes the work-in-place override in AGENTS.md legitimate instead of a fight with the skill."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_code_review", "label": "code-review", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Amendment", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It searches repo-root specs/ and docs/ alike for a spec, so moving specs under docs/specs/ preserves discoverability - the basis of the 2026-11-23 amendment."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_docs_workflow_md", "label": "docs/workflow.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_agents_md", "label": "AGENTS.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_docs_agents_issue_tracker_md", "label": "docs/agents/issue-tracker.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Skill defaults overridden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_adr_0004", "label": "ADR-0004 (docker bind-mount / shadow-volume stack)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_docs_plan_md", "label": "docs/plan.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Consequences", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow", "target": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_seven_phase_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow", "target": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_git_worktrees_disabled", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_seven_phase_workflow", "target": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_per_task_prompts", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Context", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_seven_phase_workflow", "target": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_docs_workflow_md", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0006-spec-and-plan-workflow.md", "source_location": "Decision", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_seven_phase_workflow", "target": "docs_adr_0006_spec_and_plan_workflow_docs_plan_md", "relation": "references", "confi